{"parse": {"title": "5TH-01", "pageid": 8636, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/4TH-23\" title=\"4TH-23\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">5TH-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/5TH-02\" title=\"5TH-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">5TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.B0.8F.E5.BF.83.E8.A1.8C.E8.88.B9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"小心行船\">小心行船</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 小心行船</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Bon Voyage</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>泰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>晤<span class=\"color-value\"></span>士<span class=\"color-value\"></span>河<span class=\"color-value\"></span>或<span class=\"color-value\"></span>者<span class=\"color-value\"></span>爱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>琴<span class=\"color-value\"></span>海<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>论<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>哪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>儿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>都<span class=\"color-value\"></span>应<span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>心<span class=\"color-value\"></span>行<span class=\"color-value\"></span>船<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10501</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>抓紧船舷——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_baofengyuchuanxian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_baofengyuchuanxian\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_baofengyuchuanxian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/Cg-1_4_bg_baofengyuchuanxian.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_baofengyuchuanxian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/Cg-1_4_bg_baofengyuchuanxian.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_baofengyuchuanxian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/Cg-1_4_bg_baofengyuchuanxian.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_baofengyuchuanxian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>该死的，已经没救了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>最多再过十分钟，这艘船就要沉了……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>左舱进水60%，右舱进水75%。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>这场风暴远超过了船体的承受范围。司辰，我们需要做好撤退的准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>嗯，准备开启“转念即至”传送软盘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>等等，你们在说什么？弃船？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>这只是一点小风小浪！闭闭眼就过去了！我们只要抓稳船舵——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵大浪打来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……听起来像是涡轮裂开的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>棒极了，看来现在只剩两分钟了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……一名优秀的船长绝不会抛弃她心爱的船只！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我要和APPLe号“摇滚巨轮”二世同生共死！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>那这艘船为什么是“二世”？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>星锑墨镜后的目光短暂望向了远方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>可恶，这可是苏芙比给我们买的新船啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我花了那么多心血，废了那么多口舌才摆脱那个女教师的唠叨！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"500901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-500901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-500901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"500901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-500901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-500901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-500901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-500901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我想我们最好坦然接受人生的离别，船长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>有些时候，逃跑是为了奔赴下一个战场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>雨水冲刷着收音机的外壳，让那朵精心保养的花儿也蔫了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>星锑望着这朵本不应出现的花儿，突然露出了如梦初醒的神色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>嘿，你居然还好意思跟着接腔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>要不是因为你，我们也不会沦落到——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，有一个紧急情况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>“转念即至”传送软盘无法开启。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我尝试了其他应急传送术式，但它们都无法在这片海域启动。通讯器也……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>就好像遭到了某种干扰一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我有一个问题，十四行诗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>请说，司辰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>《外派任务避难须知》上，除了“暴雨前二十四小时内，任何困难都可以向我求助”那部分以外……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>其他还写了什么有用的内容吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>……呃，你是认真的吗，维尔汀？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-302510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>星锑几乎是立刻扑向了眼前摇曳的百日菊。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti2\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti2.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti2.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti2.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我明白了，这一切全都是陷阱！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti\"><img alt=\"1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png/600px-Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png/900px-Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_at_zhuakuangdexingti.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>都是因为你！因为你播报了什么来自1999年的爱琴海游记……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我们才会跑到这片莫名其妙的海上受苦，受难，现在还要葬身鱼腹……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>想笑就笑吧，重塑之手的<span style=\"font-size:105%\">间谍！</span><span style=\"font-size:111%\">你还要装到什么时候！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-302710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-302710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-302710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我，我什么都不知道，我是无辜的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>少来了！本海盗今天就要打开你的电池盖，看看上面是不是印着“Made in 重塑”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-302710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-302710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-302710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>请不要摇晃*@#……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:94%\">如，如果我为您播报一则《如何清理家用电器中的水垢》，您的心情会变好吗？</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">不会！难道你看不到吗？船就要翻了！我的唱片和你的电池盖都要泡到水里了，</span><span style=\"font-size:122%\">永远的！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">就算是把约翰·列侬请来都没用了！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>很抱歉，我没有视觉，只能通过触觉和听觉想象……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c4/HeadIconSmall-302701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>那这则《快速上天堂101：一生必听》栏目或许更适合您……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">呜哇……受不了了！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:111%\">我的唱片、我的胡椒博士、我的海盗电台、我的APPLe号“摇滚巨轮”二世！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>真是气死我了，究竟是哪里出了差错，我才会来到这个倒霉地方——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵悠扬的音乐从收音机里传了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是的，她确实努力挑选了曲目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>尽管没人想听，但我觉得品味还不坏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>而要想回答星锑的问题……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>就需要把旋钮往前稍稍拨回。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>拨回至……1913年。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "5TH-01"}}